OL,3,GNEWSA'Systemic failures' surrounding   
OL,4,Aprisoner's death                       
OL,6,FBoley Smillie, head of the public      
OL,7,Fservice, said he accepted the findings 
OL,8,Fin the report: "I want to respect the  
OL,9,Ffact that it has yet to be formally    
OL,10,Fpublished, but its central findings are
OL,11,Fclear; there were substantial and      
OL,12,Fsystemic failures."                    
